            "sid": "LEV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaalagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kobera Abaisiraeli oti omukazi bw'anaatoolanga enda n'azaala omwana omulenzi, enaku omusanvu edhinaiririranga taabenga mulongoofu, ng'oti ni bw'ataba mulongoofu ng'ali mu biseera bye eby'okulwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwomunaana, omwana anaakeketebwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 17:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo omukazi oyo anaamalanga enaku edhindi amakumi asatu na isatu ng'atwalibwa okuba ng'akaali kutukuzibwa, olw'omusaayi ogwamuvaamu ng'azaala. Taagemenga ku kintu kitukuvu oba okwingira mu kifo ekitukuvu, okutuusa enaku edh'okutukuzibwa kwe lwe dhinaawangaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bw'anaazaalanga omwana omughala, anaamalanga enaku ikumi na ina nga tiimulongoofu, nga bw'ataba mulongoofu ng'ali mu biseera bye eby'okulwala. Olwo anaamalanga enaku edhindi nkaaga na mukaaga ng'atwalibwa okuba ng'akaali kutukuzibwa olw'omusaayi ogwamuvaamu ng'azaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho enaku edh'okutukuzibwa kwe bwe dhinaawangaku, edh'omwana omulenzi oba omughala, omukazi oyo anaaleetanga eri kabona ku mulyango gw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, entaama ento ey'omwaka omulala, ebe ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, n'enjiibwa oba eighemba eito, okuba ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaaghangayo ekigheebwayo ekyo ng'omusengo eri Musengwa Katonda, omukazi oyo yaatukuzibwa olw'omusaayi ogwamuvaamu. Eryo n'eiteeka erifuga omukazi ng'azaire omwana omulenzi oba omughala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukazi bw'aba nga taghanga kughaayo ntaama nto, anaaghangayo amaghemba amato abiri oba enjiibwa ibiri, olw'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, n'olw'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi. Kabona anaaghangayo ebigheebwayo ebyo ng'omusengo eri Musengwa Katonda olw'omukazi oyo, yaaba mulongoofu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
